{"4629850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project ACCIPITER", "steam_appid": 4629850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5020080], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The End Of the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Accipiter</strong> is a fast-paced isometric 3D chibi zombie shooter with visual novel-style storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Squad ACCIPITER</strong> — the elite (probably) trio of <strong>Amaryllis</strong>, <strong>Calissa</strong>, and <strong>Daphne</strong> as they head into the zombie-infested city of Fortuna on a simple mission: retrieve a secret document from a hidden lab. Of course, nothing goes according to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between the three operators, each with her own powerful unique skill. Blast through hordes of zombies using guns, grenades, drones, and weapon overheat mechanics while completing varied mission objectives. Upgrade your weapons at checkpoints and enjoy the squad’s hilarious banter, silly mistakes, and nonstop shenanigans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable isometric 3D chibi visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless character switching, with each girl having her own unique special skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat: shoot, throw grenades, deploy drones, and overheat weapons to mow down zombies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras/3965c7560689f3e61e2fc8a88cd18a24.poster.avif?t=1785326809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras/3965c7560689f3e61e2fc8a88cd18a24.webm?t=1785326809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras/3965c7560689f3e61e2fc8a88cd18a24.mp4?t=1785326809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons by interacting with a cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak their weapons to your liking during preparation phase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse level objectives: escort missions, point defense, item collection, and fun gimmick stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras/a4f6f74e59e062f7904876e5f01c6ff2.avif?t=1785326809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras_big/a4f6f74e59e062f7904876e5f01c6ff2.avif?t=1785326809 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras/10276a28d66334cd6deca64abb69fb4c.avif?t=1785326809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras_big/10276a28d66334cd6deca64abb69fb4c.avif?t=1785326809 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel-style story sections at the start and end of every level, featuring beautiful illustration CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear, character-driven story full of chaos, personality, and unexpected twists as the squad fights to survive the apocalypse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629850/extras/f82bb1e82580f64c853dfd0ab389282f.poster.avif?t=1785326809\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/